ould go to the doctor,\" his mother says. The doctor says, \"You ate too much last night! You should rest and drink water. Take this medicine after dinner.\" Nam sleeps all day. On Wednesday, he feels better. \"No more chicken at midnight,\" he says. Mai brings him fruit and his homework.","question":"What hurts?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"His stomach\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Nam bị ốm\".","id":"u14n4l1-e02","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"What hurts?"},"skillIds":["reading","u14.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"dress"},{"id":"c2","text":"dog"},{"id":"c3","text":"yesterday"},{"id":"c4","text":"fever"}]},"explanation":"\"fever\" = \"sốt\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c4","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"fever\" nghĩa là \"sốt\".","id":"u14n4l1-e03","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"\"sốt\" trong tiếng Anh là gì?"},"skillIds":["u14.vocab"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u14.fever"]},{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"hurts"},{"id":"t2","text":"My"},{"id":"t3","text":"leg"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"My leg hurts.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t2","t3","t1"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Câu bắt đầu bằng \"My\".","id":"u14n4l1-e04","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Sắp xếp thành câu đúng: \"Chân tôi bị đau.\""},"skillIds":["u14.grammar"],"type":"sentenceOrder","vocabularyIds":["u14.hurt"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Mr. Long"},{"id":"c2","text":"Mai"},{"id":"c3","text":"His mother"}],"passage":"On Monday, Nam does not go to school. He is sick. He has a fever and a headache, and his stomach hurts. \"You should go to the doctor,\" his mother says. The doctor says, \"You ate too much last night! You should rest and drink water. Take this medicine after dinner.\" Nam sleeps all day. On Wednesday, he feels better. \"No more chicken at midnight,\" he says. Mai brings him fruit and his homework.","question":"Who says he should go to the doctor?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"His mother\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Nam bị ốm\".","id":"u14n4l1-e05","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Who says he should go to the doctor?"},"skillIds":["reading","u14.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"My"},{"id":"t2","text":"stomach"},{"id":"t3","text":"hotel"},{"id":"t4","text":"learns"},{"id":"t5","text":"loves"},{"id":"t6","text":"hurts"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"My stomach hurts.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t1","t2","t6"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"hurt\" = đau; \"stomach\" = bụng","id":"u14n4l1-e06","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Dịch câu này: \"Tôi bị đau bụng.\""},"skillIds":["u14.grammar"],"type":"wordBank","vocabularyIds":["u14.hurt","u14.stomach"]},{"content":{"maxChars":40,"placeholder":"Điền từ còn thiếu"},"explanation":"Từ đúng: \"should\" → You should not drink coffee at night.","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["should"],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"\"nên\" trong tiếng Anh là \"s...\"","id":"u14n4l1-e07","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"You ___ not drink coffee at night. — \"Bạn không nên uống cà phê vào ban đêm.\""},"skillIds":["u14.grammar"],"type":"fillBlank","vocabularyIds":["u14.should","u3.coffee","u3.drink","u5.night"]},{"content":{"maxChars":200,"placeholder":"Viết bằng tiếng Anh"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"I feel sick.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["I feel sick."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"\"sick\" = ốm; \"feel\" = cảm thấy","id":"u14n4l1-e08","prompt":{"locale":